WEBVTT

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.639
- Begin.
- Yes, ma'am.

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:16.869
Commencing Resonance.

00:00:50.475 --> 00:00:53.808
- Irregularity detected!
- Lt's no use! I can't stop it!

00:01:06.157 --> 00:01:11.396
Why can the ISDA folks do what we cannot?

00:01:11.396 --> 00:01:13.023
Why?!

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:34.786
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:34.786 --> 00:01:40.692
even the reason for this pain

00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:46.364
Crouching over, making excuses

00:01:46.364 --> 00:01:49.561
I must have...

00:01:50.969 --> 00:01:57.275
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:01:57.275 --> 00:02:04.883
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:02:04.883 --> 00:02:07.752
I'll always be with you

00:02:07.752 --> 00:02:10.255
see the sky in front of you

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:14.624
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:16.428 --> 00:02:21.967
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:02:21.967 --> 00:02:24.636
I sing out

00:02:24.636 --> 00:02:33.305
May my voice reach you

00:03:06.478 --> 00:03:09.214
This is where Toa is?

00:03:09.214 --> 00:03:10.841
Yeah.

00:03:27.999 --> 00:03:30.991
No doubt about it. Toa is here.

00:03:49.087 --> 00:03:51.523
You forgot to recharge it again, didn't you?

00:03:51.523 --> 00:03:53.252
Shut up!

00:03:58.263 --> 00:04:00.865
That's right, it's going
to rain this afternoon.

00:04:00.865 --> 00:04:02.696
Let's go home.

00:04:23.588 --> 00:04:25.954
The Moon's rain is cold.

00:04:29.928 --> 00:04:33.965
- What's wrong?
- The song... stopped...

00:04:33.965 --> 00:04:35.728
You don't hear it?

00:04:38.436 --> 00:04:40.063
Toa!

00:04:42.941 --> 00:04:45.210
Doesn't look like she's here.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.978
But I'm sure it was coming from here!

00:04:46.978 --> 00:04:49.747
I heard Toa's song coming from here!

00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:52.417
How can you say for sure it was here?

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:54.452
Well, I...

00:04:54.452 --> 00:04:57.751
All I can say is, that's how it feels.

00:05:01.059 --> 00:05:02.549
Gio!

00:05:04.229 --> 00:05:12.303
I told you, if Toa isn't on the Moon,
then I'm leaving you behind.

00:05:12.303 --> 00:05:18.476
Wait a minute, Gio!
Toa was definitely here! Gio!

00:05:18.476 --> 00:05:21.112
Quiet down!

00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:25.283
I will now give an accounting of
the string of events that happened

00:05:25.283 --> 00:05:29.621
yesterday in Shin-Ogasawara Terminal City.

00:05:29.621 --> 00:05:35.026
But before I do, I would like to
speak about the asteroid Thanatos,

00:05:35.026 --> 00:05:38.930
which is holding position
in Pluto's old orbit.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.965
What does that have to do with anything?!

00:05:40.965 --> 00:05:42.867
Don't go changing the subject!

00:05:42.867 --> 00:05:45.303
What exactly were those
monsters yesterday?!

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:50.639
Thanatos is not an asteroid!
It is an extraterrestrial life form!

00:05:51.843 --> 00:05:53.978
The two giant creatures that appeared

00:05:53.978 --> 00:05:56.447
on the Shin-Ogasawara Bridge yesterday

00:05:56.447 --> 00:05:59.317
are extraterrestrial life forms, like Thanatos.

00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:02.554
We are calling them Dragons.

00:06:02.554 --> 00:06:06.124
The other type of Dragons,
which were fighting those Dragons,

00:06:06.124 --> 00:06:10.828
are earth-born Dragons,
biological weapons created by ISDA,

00:06:10.828 --> 00:06:15.133
to resist the threat of
Thanatos coming to Earth.

00:06:15.133 --> 00:06:18.703
Earth-born? What are you talking about?

00:06:18.703 --> 00:06:21.806
Are you saying you've been
secretly raising these monsters?!

00:06:21.806 --> 00:06:24.876
They are not monsters! They are Dragons.

00:06:24.876 --> 00:06:27.912
We have formulated a
plan to attack Thanatos,

00:06:27.912 --> 00:06:31.015
using these earth-born Dragons!

00:06:31.015 --> 00:06:36.020
That is the totality of D Project,
and the true mission of the Dragonauts!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.723
The Dragonauts are
astronauts, aren't they?!

00:06:38.723 --> 00:06:40.714
You've been deceiving us?!

00:06:42.393 --> 00:06:44.896
The Earth is being targeted!

00:06:44.896 --> 00:06:47.932
The only means that mankind has to resist

00:06:47.932 --> 00:06:50.168
is D Project!

00:06:50.168 --> 00:06:53.695
You're getting too worked up, Mister.

00:07:02.413 --> 00:07:06.351
Kamishina Jin's ID has been
used in the city on the Moon.

00:07:06.351 --> 00:07:08.920
They are unmistakably on the Moon.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:14.025
Copy that. I have already
arrived on the Moon myself.

00:07:14.025 --> 00:07:17.395
You move as quickly as ever, huh?

00:07:17.395 --> 00:07:20.865
Not as quickly as you, though.

00:07:20.865 --> 00:07:23.034
Mister Cyril...

00:07:23.034 --> 00:07:27.805
I wonder if holding a press conference
so soon was a wise decision.

00:07:27.805 --> 00:07:31.901
It was the proper step to take.
Anyone would have done so.

00:07:41.286 --> 00:07:46.491
So, will you allow us to take care of
the capture of the escaped Dragon?

00:07:46.491 --> 00:07:48.393
It would be most helpful if you did.

00:07:48.393 --> 00:07:53.464
I have a lot that I have to do,
here, as well. However,

00:07:53.464 --> 00:07:57.435
I want you to give him back to ISDA
immediately after you catch him.

00:07:57.435 --> 00:08:00.738
Copy that. From here on, the Girouard Force

00:08:00.738 --> 00:08:04.809
is under contract to ISDA to capture Gio.

00:08:04.809 --> 00:08:09.576
Be certain that all of this
remains secret, Major Garnet.

00:08:18.756 --> 00:08:20.815
Easy for him to say.

00:08:30.168 --> 00:08:35.373
A counterfeit, huh?
I wish I didn't have to use this.

00:08:35.373 --> 00:08:37.975
Now that the truth about
D Project is out in the open,

00:08:37.975 --> 00:08:39.877
and the press knows about it,

00:08:39.877 --> 00:08:44.015
the higher-ups have decided on
early implementation of the project.

00:08:44.015 --> 00:08:47.685
As such, from now on,
the Lindworm Unit's top priority

00:08:47.685 --> 00:08:53.057
will be moving D Project forward.

00:08:53.057 --> 00:08:56.294
Also, the search for the runaway Gio

00:08:56.294 --> 00:08:59.364
has been left to the Girouard Force.

00:08:59.364 --> 00:09:01.699
Why are they being brought into this?

00:09:01.699 --> 00:09:03.634
They don't have anything
to do with us, do they?

00:09:03.634 --> 00:09:08.039
Yeah, Raina! We deal with
our own people ourselves!

00:09:08.039 --> 00:09:10.508
Those are the orders from above.

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:11.998
Got it?

00:09:44.242 --> 00:09:46.710
Yo! Mind if I sit here?

00:09:50.515 --> 00:09:54.212
I hear Kamishina Jin is a
childhood friend of yours.

00:09:58.022 --> 00:10:01.125
He said something to me.

00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:04.262
I want to know the truth!
That's why I'm going to go see Toa.

00:10:04.262 --> 00:10:06.297
See her, and find out for sure!

00:10:06.297 --> 00:10:11.202
That's what he told me,
and then he rode Gio to the Moon.

00:10:11.202 --> 00:10:14.705
I'm sure the Album is on the Moon.

00:10:14.705 --> 00:10:16.240
Go on ahead.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.368
Right. Come on, let's go.

00:10:22.613 --> 00:10:24.315
I don't know the reason why,

00:10:24.315 --> 00:10:27.218
but I'm sure that Gio went
to see the Album, too.

00:10:27.218 --> 00:10:31.489
So I don't think he dislikes you,
or anything like that.

00:10:31.489 --> 00:10:34.258
He went chasing the Album to the Moon...

00:10:34.258 --> 00:10:38.429
Yeah. So cheer up. Okay?

00:10:38.429 --> 00:10:41.728
Would you tell me more
about what happened?

00:10:44.302 --> 00:10:47.601
About the Album being on the Moon?

00:10:51.342 --> 00:10:55.246
Toa is definitely here
somewhere, on the Moon.

00:10:55.246 --> 00:10:59.116
I can tell. I...

00:10:59.116 --> 00:11:00.811
...can tell.

00:11:28.779 --> 00:11:31.009
Who are you people?

00:11:32.517 --> 00:11:34.519
Where are you planning to take me?!

00:11:34.519 --> 00:11:36.009
Silence!

00:11:37.622 --> 00:11:39.453
The Girouard Force?

00:11:50.201 --> 00:11:52.336
Line secured.

00:11:52.336 --> 00:11:54.804
All right, begin.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.402
Here.

00:12:06.751 --> 00:12:09.584
Drink it. It will warm you up.

00:12:12.823 --> 00:12:15.383
Uh-oh. Is it on the fritz?

00:12:17.194 --> 00:12:20.027
Calling the Communicator, Gio.

00:12:22.667 --> 00:12:27.038
Only you Dragons will be
able to hear this message.

00:12:27.038 --> 00:12:30.906
We have Kamishina Jin in custody.

00:12:32.577 --> 00:12:37.114
If you want him released,
surrender to our forces immediately.

00:12:37.114 --> 00:12:42.253
Repeat, we have Kamishina Jin in custody.

00:12:42.253 --> 00:12:43.880
Jin?

00:12:45.056 --> 00:12:46.724
What's the matter, Toa?

00:12:46.724 --> 00:12:51.195
The Moon city's southwest
resource mining site will be the place.

00:12:51.195 --> 00:12:52.753
That is all.

00:12:57.935 --> 00:13:00.972
The CSS emitting carriage is on station.

00:13:00.972 --> 00:13:04.108
CSS signal anchor emitter has been set.

00:13:04.108 --> 00:13:07.378
All right, now stand by.

00:13:07.378 --> 00:13:10.047
How are you feeling, boy?

00:13:10.047 --> 00:13:13.317
You're the Giroaurd Force, right?

00:13:13.317 --> 00:13:16.153
Just what is your objective here?

00:13:16.153 --> 00:13:21.626
You're going to serve as bait,
for us to catch a big fish.

00:13:21.626 --> 00:13:27.765
So that's it. But it won't do
any good. Gio won't come.

00:13:27.765 --> 00:13:29.934
He's abandoned me!

00:13:29.934 --> 00:13:34.305
A Communicator has
abandoned his Master?

00:13:34.305 --> 00:13:37.808
Don't try to trick us. We do know
at least that the Resonance

00:13:37.808 --> 00:13:40.845
between a Master and
Communicator is absolute.

00:13:40.845 --> 00:13:42.446
That again?!

00:13:42.446 --> 00:13:44.676
What is this "Resonance"?!

00:13:46.283 --> 00:13:48.786
I don't know what any of this is...

00:13:48.786 --> 00:13:52.189
Don't get cocky!

00:13:52.189 --> 00:13:55.960
We're not playing around, boy!

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.295
No way, you can't!

00:13:58.295 --> 00:14:00.464
Yeah? Really?

00:14:00.464 --> 00:14:03.501
Really! Believe me!

00:14:03.501 --> 00:14:05.128
I'm sorry!

00:14:17.948 --> 00:14:19.540
Toa...

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:26.691
Has the Lindworm Unit's penalty
in regards to the incident

00:14:26.691 --> 00:14:29.627
with Spirytus been decided yet?

00:14:29.627 --> 00:14:34.565
Not yet. In order to put
D Project first, it's been put off.

00:14:34.565 --> 00:14:37.668
I'm relieved to hear that.

00:14:37.668 --> 00:14:42.206
Is that all you wanted to ask?

00:14:42.206 --> 00:14:45.369
I hear the Album is on the Moon.

00:14:47.411 --> 00:14:51.148
Please dispatch the
Dragonauts to the Moon.

00:14:51.148 --> 00:14:57.722
I told you, the Dragonauts' mission
is to move D Project forward.

00:14:57.722 --> 00:15:02.819
Don't you want to catch the culprit
of the shuttle accident yourself?

00:15:07.231 --> 00:15:09.934
Yes, we will bring the captured Gio

00:15:09.934 --> 00:15:12.770
to the military research facility at once.

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:16.433
If you would please deal with
the aftermath with ISDA.

00:15:18.576 --> 00:15:22.446
We need a live Communicator.

00:15:22.446 --> 00:15:26.450
If we can just crack the Resonance formula,

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.519
then from then on, the ISDA...

00:15:28.519 --> 00:15:30.387
Target sighted!

00:15:30.387 --> 00:15:32.857
Gio has shown up!

00:15:32.857 --> 00:15:35.693
He's here.

00:15:35.693 --> 00:15:37.388
Gio?

00:15:48.572 --> 00:15:52.309
It appears that he hasn't
abandoned you yet, has he?

00:15:52.309 --> 00:15:54.903
Gio... why?

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:02.781
Yes... come!

00:16:20.938 --> 00:16:23.741
Target has entered the airlock.

00:16:23.741 --> 00:16:27.411
He will reach the trap point
in roughly 19 seconds.

00:16:27.411 --> 00:16:30.403
That's right. Come this way.

00:16:40.624 --> 00:16:44.829
- Nine seconds to trap point. 8... 7...
- It's a trap! Stay away, Gio!

00:16:44.829 --> 00:16:47.097
- 6... 5...
- Sit down!

00:16:47.097 --> 00:16:49.099
4... 3...

00:16:49.099 --> 00:16:51.932
2... 1... 0!

00:17:08.786 --> 00:17:14.625
If we flood your body directly
with CSS, you can't Actualize.

00:17:14.625 --> 00:17:16.126
Seize Gio!

00:17:16.126 --> 00:17:17.718
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:29.006 --> 00:17:31.031
You can still move?!

00:17:34.678 --> 00:17:38.883
What's the matter?!
You're moving slow, Communicator!

00:17:38.883 --> 00:17:41.044
I can't move very well...

00:17:48.525 --> 00:17:50.227
Incredible...

00:17:50.227 --> 00:17:51.854
Gio...

00:18:11.448 --> 00:18:13.541
Settle down!

00:18:16.353 --> 00:18:18.014
Gio...

00:18:20.424 --> 00:18:22.119
That was close.

00:18:25.562 --> 00:18:28.929
You can still fight back,
even after raising the CSS level?!

00:18:31.068 --> 00:18:35.873
To think that Communicator Gio's
physical abilities were this advanced...

00:18:35.873 --> 00:18:37.465
Why, you!

00:18:39.576 --> 00:18:42.374
O-Oh, no! The CSS!

00:18:45.282 --> 00:18:46.909
What?!

00:18:50.955 --> 00:18:52.889
You bastard!

00:18:59.997 --> 00:19:02.966
- Gio!
- Let's go, Jin.

00:19:12.242 --> 00:19:14.301
Send out the Agathion!

00:19:16.347 --> 00:19:18.838
Agathion attacking!

00:19:35.933 --> 00:19:37.594
A Dragon?!

00:19:41.972 --> 00:19:43.940
Here he comes, Gio!

00:20:00.624 --> 00:20:02.216
Gio!

00:20:17.741 --> 00:20:22.838
Unable to control the Agathion!
The shock cut off my connection!

00:20:31.889 --> 00:20:34.824
That Dragon is out of control.

00:20:52.876 --> 00:20:57.581
Sure enough, we can't beat him
with a counterfeit Dragon.

00:20:57.581 --> 00:21:02.348
I will get my hands on
that Resonance formula!

00:21:19.636 --> 00:21:25.370
Don't you want to catch the culprit
of the shuttle accident yourself?

00:21:32.749 --> 00:21:35.081
Why did you come back?

00:21:38.055 --> 00:21:41.391
I thought you were leaving me behind.

00:21:41.391 --> 00:21:48.565
I said that if Toa wasn't on the Moon,
I'd leave you behind. But,

00:21:48.565 --> 00:21:53.434
if Toa is on the Moon,
we'll find her together.

00:22:08.519 --> 00:22:15.192
The moment our eyes met,

00:22:15.192 --> 00:22:21.999
I felt like the sadness was beginning

00:22:21.999 --> 00:22:28.672
The memories that can't be blotted out

00:22:28.672 --> 00:22:35.874
bind our hearts together, even now

00:22:37.714 --> 00:22:44.555
Though there are as many people

00:22:44.555 --> 00:22:47.558
as there are in these thousands of stars,

00:22:47.558 --> 00:22:51.461
you're the only one that I can see

00:22:51.461 --> 00:22:54.631
Though we may not be able to meet,

00:22:54.631 --> 00:22:57.534
and our wishes might not be granted,

00:22:57.534 --> 00:23:03.840
our growing feelings
are sure to last forever

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:10.847
If fate tears the two of us apart,

00:23:10.847 --> 00:23:17.688
I believe that just meeting
each other was a miracle

00:23:17.688 --> 00:23:24.261
Look how it flows, like this rain

00:23:24.261 --> 00:23:30.334
I want to let all of my affection fall on you

00:23:30.334 --> 00:23:34.532
Rain of Love

00:23:42.846 --> 00:23:46.183
Whew, working non-stop
behind the scenes is tiring.

00:23:46.183 --> 00:23:48.352
We're always in the command center, huh?

00:23:48.352 --> 00:23:50.687
Doesn't the command center seem cold?

00:23:50.687 --> 00:23:52.756
I'm sure Commander Sakaki finds it stuffy.

00:23:52.756 --> 00:23:54.758
Yeah, he's always so serious, huh?

00:23:54.758 --> 00:23:56.426
Stop that, it's rude, you know.

00:23:56.426 --> 00:23:59.029
- It's okay, it's okay.
- Nobody is listening to us.

00:23:59.029 --> 00:24:01.031
No, the mike looks like it's turned on.

00:24:01.031 --> 00:24:03.233
Eh?! Um... um...

00:24:03.233 --> 00:24:05.869
Next time, after missing
each other, the two will finally...

00:24:05.869 --> 00:24:08.201
Uh, I don't think you're
smoothing this one over.
